* bbs_lane_regression.dts
* AI-BBS command-surface smoke (AIF-052/054/055).
*
* Exercises the BBS command path in-engine (no socket). The guest-scoping SECURITY
* regression is the socket smoke bbs_smoke.ps1 (host side) -- server-side permission
* denial needs the listener and cannot be driven from a script.
*
* Steps:
*   USER LOGIN member.derald   owner (credential-less bootstrap on an unsecured store);
*                              owner exemption lets every BBS op through
*   BBS BOARDS                 tops up + lists the seeded rooms
*                              (governance / afb.chat / notice / lounge / guestbook)
*   BBS READ board.governance  renders the read-only SYSGRANT projection
*   BBS POST board.afb.chat    round-trip: post a marker, then read it back
*
* Read-mostly: the first BBS BOARDS tops up board.lounge / board.guestbook if missing
* (idempotent, additive); no fixture table is touched. Out of the default suite
* (mutates the board store on first run; explicit run).
*
* Run:  REGRESSION RUN BBS_LANE

SET ECHO OFF
STOP_ON_ERROR OFF

USER LOGIN member.derald

FORMULA "BBS-LANE-BEGIN"

BBS BOARDS

BBS READ board.governance

BBS POST board.afb.chat SUBJECT regr-marker BODY bbs_lane_regression round-trip marker
BBS READ board.afb.chat LAST 1

* --- AIF-057 worklog handoff round-trip: post a handoff, read it back ---
BBS POST board.worklog SUBJECT AIF-057 BODY RUN=regr STATE=smoke DID=worklog round-trip NEXT-AGENT=none
BBS READ board.worklog LAST 1

FORMULA "BBS-LANE-END"

USER LOGOUT
